<p> KENTUCKY    148,800     146,400     123,120</p>
<p> TENN	   76,840	76,840	63,720</p>
<p> ALABAMA	21,600	21,600	16,500</p>
<p> MISS	   56,730	56,730	26,125</p>
<p> ARKANSAS     18,050	18,050	 9,775</p>
<p> LOUISIANA    58,850	58,850	23,205</p>
<p> TEXAS	 171,000     171,000     216,600</p>
<p> COLORADO    131,600     131,600	92,130</p>
<p> OTHERS	159,818     159,818     123,471</p>
<p> TOTAL     9,221,411   9,012,148   7,373,876</p>
